{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1154876-looking-to-play-demon-the-decent","id":1154876,"title":"Looking to play Demon: the Decent","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-01T16:26:44-07:00","id":1154876,"title":"Looking to play Demon: the Decent","content":"I have been reading through the Demon: The Descent as I have a great interest in running this game, but whenever I read through a new system I don't really get a feel for the game and mechanics unless I run through it as a player and so far finding anyone who has played it has become somewhat difficult. <br /> <br /> For this reason, I thought I'd seek out a game on the official forums.<br /> <br /> I'm basically looking for an already assembled group I can join--preferably with an experienced Storyteller--so that things run fairly smoothly and I can learn the gameplay mechanics properly. Whether it's with experienced players or fellow novices works for me.<br /> <br /> I own copy of the core book, revisions for 2nd Ed of CoD, as well as the Flowers of Hell Players Guide.<br /> <br /> I should state that I am actually well versed in classic WoD settings and have run quite a few games, but am an amateur when it comes to the new settings and lore mainly because it never held much interest for me personally. <br /> <br /> But when I heard the rave about Demon I decided to take a look and was pleasantly surprised by the setting and the style of the game and wanted to try it myself. <br /> <br /> Any games with open spots or any recommendations would be appreciated <br /> <br /> Thank You :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2779-darkeye4876","name":"Darkeye4876","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-11T10:57:00-08:00","id":1157784,"title":"","content":"Ive run a short DtD game before. Im looking to play the darn thing myself. If you don't find a game I could give you some pointers I learned from the short experience I had with the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13446,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13446-silent_carrot","user":"Silent_Carrot","date":". 11-11-2017, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13446-silent_carrot","name":"Silent_Carrot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-12T05:21:46-08:00","id":1157909,"title":"","content":"Also it always makes me laugh how when there is any activity in these DtD threads, the view count starts increasing quicker.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13446-silent_carrot","name":"Silent_Carrot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-13T17:31:39-08:00","id":1158302,"title":"","content":"Lol, actually yea any advice would be greatly appreciated. I have read a few play by posts and seen some character concepts thus far, but still, have not found any live games. A real pity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2779-darkeye4876","name":"Darkeye4876","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-02T08:38:56-08:00","id":1164540,"title":"","content":"Alrighty a'here I go:<br /> Tips (From my experience with Demon)<br /> 1. If it doesn't make into the game don't worry about it. Demons got a lot of cool stuff (Gadgets, Hacking Infrastructure, Facades, etc), but trying to include it all got over whelming for me and my players.<br /> <br /> 2. Think of ways complications can be turned into assets. I didn't present any possibilities to turn problems around on themselves, so me and my players didn't get the full espionage experience.<br /> <br /> 3. Demon powers are OP. If it feels like the players are just relying on there powers, then they are. Let them do it, but every once in a while through a wrench into the scenario.<br /> <br /> 4. Secrets, secrets, secrets. I would normally have things out in the open. It's a game of ciphers, secret locations, and passwords. Really push this, but don't force it.<br /> <br /> 5. Take it slow. My greatest failure is I let things progress too quickly, denying my players time to stop and think about what was going on.<br /> <br /> 6. Keep Covers simple. I had a player that had a Cover within a Cover. It got complicated quick. Keep it simple.<br /> <br /> Some of these are common sense, I suppose. Some of these are because I'm a poopy GM, I suppose lol. Hope this little tid-bit helps. If you have any questions about the setting itself, please don't hesitate to ask!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13446,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13446-silent_carrot","user":"Silent_Carrot","date":". 12-02-2017, 11:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13446-silent_carrot","name":"Silent_Carrot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T11:25:22-08:00","id":1166504,"title":"","content":"I run Demon The Descent all the time. I'm currently running one. I would love to play in one if you guys are gonna play. I really love demon the descent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T16:12:08-08:00","id":1167177,"title":"","content":"Welp, colour me interested, Demons look deliciously customisable and I would love to play...just need an ST <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T07:07:19-08:00","id":1167289,"title":"","content":"I would like to play as well. I am not familiar enough to run it, but I could certainly play it! I have only played Demons in cross over games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014